# 📦 Inventory Management System

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.x-blue?logo=python)
![Tkinter](https://img.shields.io/badge/GUI-Tkinter-green)
![MySQL](https://img.shields.io/badge/Database-MySQL-orange?logo=mysql)
![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Project-Completed-brightgreen)

A Python GUI-based Inventory Management System to manage products, customers, and transactions efficiently, with automated invoice generation.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 📦 Add, update, and delete products
- 👥 Manage customer details
- 💰 Record transactions
- 🧾 Generate PDF invoices automatically
- 🔄 Real-time inventory updates

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- 🐍 Python
- 🖼 Tkinter
- 🗄 MySQL
- 📄 ReportLab

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
stock-management-system/
│
├── secbp.py
├── mysqlconnector.py
├── requirements.txt
├── database.sql
└── README.md
```

---

## ⚙️ Installation

### 1️⃣ Clone the Repository

```
git clone https://github.com/malothumanjula/inventory-management-system.git
cd stock-management-system
```

### 2️⃣ Install Dependencies

```
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 3️⃣ Setup Database

```
CREATE DATABASE stock_db;
USE stock_db;
SOURCE database.sql;
```

### 4️⃣ Run the Application

```
python secbp.py
```

---

## 🖥️ Usage

- Run the application
- Add products and customers
- Perform transactions
- Generate invoices

